{"story":{"id":"event-first-contact-5071","title":{"zh":"色彩语言学","en":"Colorful Linguistics"},"category":"society","kind":"family","image":"art/b9c89635229802fe5b98.webp","start":"first_contact.5070","chapters":4,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"我们的[This.Owner.GetLinguists]在解码[This.ContactCountry.GetName]语言的过程中取得了一项突破性进展。他们使用的文字系统里包含了将近一千七百万种字符，每个字符恰好可以和红-绿-蓝色值一一对应。尽管颇为费解，我们的语言学家们认为他们是可以破译这种外星语言的，只是还需要再花上一些时间。","en":"Our [This.Owner.GetLinguists] have made a breakthrough deciphering the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] language. They use an alphabet consisting of almost seventeen million unique characters, which in turn correspond with a color on the red-green-blue spectrum. "},"review":{"status":"reviewed","date":"2026-10-13","reviewer":"c7b-society (resumed)","scope":{"zh":"色彩语言学全部4个事件及阶段衔接。","en":"All 4 Colorful Linguistics events and the stage hand-off."},"sources":["events/first_contact_events.txt:7171-7369","common/first_contact/00_first_contact.txt:644-677","common/first_contact/00_first_contact.txt:2131-2168"],"uncertain":[],"guide":"public/summaries/event-first-contact-5071.md"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"first_contact.5070","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry","triggers":[{"zh":"首次接触","en":"First contact"}]},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"first_contact.5071","parent":"n1","via":{"kind":"bridge","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：色彩语言学阶段（对方主动）(难度5) / 色彩语言学阶段（对方谨慎）(难度7)","en":"Stage: colorful linguistics stage (proactive) (difficulty 5) / colorful linguistics stage (cautious) (difficulty 7)"},"conditional":true,"source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-5071.json","optionIndex":0,"option":"first_contact.5070.A"},"children":["n3","n4"]},"n3":{"doc":"first_contact.5072","parent":"n2","via":{"option":"first_contact.5071.A","optionIndex":0,"modified":true,"chance":0.6667,"group":"r13217","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_events.txt:7251"},"children":[]},"n4":{"doc":"first_contact.5073","parent":"n2","via":{"option":"first_contact.5071.A","optionIndex":0,"modified":true,"chance":0.3333,"group":"r13217","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"kind":"option","source":"events/first_contact_events.txt:7268"},"children":[]}}},"groups":[{"kind":"exclusive","members":["first_contact.5072","first_contact.5073"],"label":{"zh":"唱歌接触的结果","en":"Outcome of the song contact"},"note":{"zh":"30 天后隐藏随机 66:33（99 总权重）；任一方亲异族使 5072 ×2（狂热 ×4），任一方排外使 5073 ×2（狂热 ×4）。","en":"After 30 days, hidden random 66:33; a xenophile on either side makes 5072 ×2 (×4 if fanatic), a xenophobe on either side makes 5073 ×2 (×4 if fanatic)."}}]},"chapters":[{"id":"first_contact.5070","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"色彩语言学","en":"Colorful Linguistics"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们的[This.Owner.GetLinguists]在解码[This.ContactCountry.GetName]语言的过程中取得了一项突破性进展。他们使用的文字系统里包含了将近一千七百万种字符，每个字符恰好可以和红-绿-蓝色值一一对应。尽管颇为费解，我们的语言学家们认为他们是可以破译这种外星语言的，只是还需要再花上一些时间。","en":"Our [This.Owner.GetLinguists] have made a breakthrough deciphering the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] language. They use an alphabet consisting of almost seventeen million unique characters, which in turn correspond with a color on the red-green-blue spectrum. Although convoluted, our linguists are convinced they will be able to decipher the alien language. They just need some more time."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b9c89635229802fe5b98.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact.5070.A","label":{"zh":"一路绿灯。","en":"Green lights all the way."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"first_contact.5071","kind":"bridge","conditional":true,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"bridge","source":"content/stories/event-first-contact-5071.json","label":{"zh":"进入阶段：色彩语言学阶段（对方主动）(难度5) / 色彩语言学阶段（对方谨慎）(难度7)","en":"Stage: colorful linguistics stage (proactive) (difficulty 5) / colorful linguistics stage (cautious) (difficulty 7)"},"story":"event-first-contact-5071"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/first_contact_events.txt","line":7170},"sets":["first_contact_colorful_linguistics_chain"],"names":{"This.ContactCountry.GetName":{"zh":"该帝国","en":"that empire"}}},{"id":"first_contact.5071","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"解码彩色语言","en":"Deciphering Colorful Language"},"texts":[{"zh":"通过运用十六进制数位系统，我们的数学家和[This.Owner.GetLinguists]几乎就快要破译[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的色彩语言了。官方也正在起草第一次接触协议。\n\n通过对[This.ContactCountry.GetName]语言的研究，我们发现他们的文化包罗万象，而且沟通上产生误解的可能性非常高。现在我们必须决定沟通的方针究竟是倾向于他们的逻辑型还是偏向他们的情感表达……","en":"By utilizing a hexadecimal positional numeral system, our mathematicians and [This.Owner.GetLinguists] are on the verge of a colorful language breakthrough with the [This.ContactCountry.GetName]. Officials are preparing first contact protocols.\n\nThrough studying the [This.ContactCountry.GetName] language, we know their culture is vast. The potential risk for misunderstanding is high. Now we must decide if we should appeal to their sense of logic, or to their emotions..."},{"zh":"通过运用十六进制数位系统，我们几乎就要破译[This.ContactCountry.GetName]的色彩语言了。第一次接触协议也正在起草中。\n\n我们现在可以选择通过富有文化特质的问候来取悦他们的情感或是尝试进行一种更复杂的但高效的表达方式。","en":"By utilizing a hexadecimal positional numeral system, the collective is on the verge of a colorful language breakthrough with the [This.ContactCountry.GetName]. We are preparing first contact protocols.\n\nWe can now either pander to their emotions with a culturally significant greeting, or we can attempt a more complex protocol to increase potential efficiency."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/b9c89635229802fe5b98.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"first_contact.5071.A","label":{"zh":"用音乐与他们打招呼吧！","en":"Contact them in song!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"我们会尝试与[This.ContactCountry.GetName]建立情感联系。","en":"We will attempt to forge an emotional connection with the [This.ContactCountry.GetName]."}],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"first_contact.5072","kind":"option","conditional":true,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"option","chance":0.6667,"group":"r13217","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"modified":true,"so